flowchart TB
  subgraph HOST[Trusted host]
    direction TB
    A[Ingestion APIs<br/>URL capture · file or folder<br/>Async large-file upload<br/>Transport not specified] --> B[Store all originals<br/>Wait for completion<br/>Choose one processor]
    B --> I[Input: inputId + originals array<br/>Each original: stored details<br/>+ optional filename / path / provenance]
  end
  subgraph PLUGIN[Untrusted processor]
    direction LR
    C[Process batch once<br/>Scoped read · write · transcribe] --> D[Return 1+ manifests<br/>Explicit artifact sets + metadata]
  end
  I --> C
  subgraph SAVE[Trusted host owns publication]
    direction LR
    E{Validate ALL manifests<br/>References + item membership} -->|valid| F[Atomically create items<br/>Host assigns each item ID<br/>Mark input processed]
    E -->|invalid / failed| X[No published items]
    F --> G[Per-item search + fallback<br/>Optional isolated viewer<br/>Only explicit artifact set]
  end
  D --> E
